# Terminal (Windows)
- The shell is **Windows PowerShell 5.1** — `pwsh`/PowerShell 7 is NOT installed.
- Do NOT chain with `&&` / `||` (not supported in 5.1). Use `;` or separate commands; use `if ($LASTEXITCODE -ne 0) { ... }` for conditionals.
- Use PowerShell syntax: `$env:NAME = "value"` (not `export`), `Remove-Item -Recurse` (not `rm -rf`), `Get-Content` (not `cat` pipes with bash flags).
- Package manager is **pnpm** only (`pnpm --filter @s-project/core-kernel <script>`). Never use npm/yarn to install.
- Supabase runs locally in **Docker** (DB port 54322). If DB is unreachable, check `pnpm supabase:status` / Docker Desktop before changing code.
- Risky actions (deleting data/files, `main` merge/tag/push, pilot/staging upgrade, non-local `db reset`) need explicit user approval — `AGENTS.md` §4. Committing on your own feature branch is fine.
